## Historical CC0 note

The repository root previously exposed CC0 1.0 Universal. CC0 is designed to be irrevocable; this release does not attempt to withdraw permissions already granted for earlier public versions. The MIT / CC BY 4.0 policy above governs new original contributions and newly published versions from the licensing change forward, subject to any rights already granted and any file-specific terms.

Scientific priority, citation and licensing permission are separate. Please cite Jeromie N. Beasley and the relevant paper/release DOI when using research results, proof material or substantial software from this release.